+/* Below BW_GAIN should be added to the SNR value of every ppdu based on the
+ * bandwidth. This table is obtained from HALPHY.
+ * BW         BW_Gain
+ * 20          0
+ * 40          3dBm
+ * 80          6dBm
+ * 160/80P80   9dBm
+ * 320         12dBm
+ */
